sequenceDiagram
    participant Web as Web Shop
    actor Buyer
    participant Pay as Payment Gateway
    participant Ledger
    actor Courier as Delivery Courier
    Buyer->>Web: Place an order
    Web->>Pay: Charge the card
    Pay-->>Web: Approved
    Web->>Stock: Reserve the items
    Stock-->>Web: Reserved
    Web-->>Buyer: Order confirmed
    Web->>Courier: Collect the parcel
